 "library": {
  "title": "Ladder bookshelf 700x400x1800",
  "description": "Leaning ladder-style bookshelf in dark wood, 700 wide and 1800 tall. The side rails taper from 400 deep at the floor to 40 at the top, and it has four shelves (430 pitch) that get shallower going up, each holding books. Its origin is the back-left-bottom corner.",
